{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "rulesetVersion": "osmand-zh-2026.11.10",
  "minimumAppVersionCode": 83,
  "createdAt": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z",
  "publisher": "PebbleNTN maintainers",
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "osmand-roundabout-street-zh",
      "enabled": true,
      "priority": 191,
      "packageNames": [
        "net.osmand",
        "net.osmand.plus",
        "net.osmand.dev",
        "net.osmand.huawei"
      ],
      "comment": "Variant of osmand-roundabout-zh one step above it (#134): bigText's first line is OsmAnd's instruction (route_roundabout_short '从第 %d 出口驶离' / '在第 %d 個出口往'), the street and the next step's distance. Road line: that line without the distance; compact: from '第' on. Second line and ETA: the summary line's arrival clock.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "field": "combinedText",
          "operator": "regex",
          "value": "圓環|环岛|\\d+\\s*個?\\s*出口"
        },
        {
          "field": "bigText",
          "operator": "regex",
          "value": "^(?:(?:向[右左]急[转轉]|稍向[右左][转轉]|[右左][转轉]|掉头|迴轉)(?:然后|后|後)直行|直行|靠[左右]行[驶走]|(?:从|在|自)第\\s*\\d+\\s*個?\\s*出口(?:驶离|驶出到|過去|往|離開)?)[^\\S\\n]+(?![\\d.,]+[^\\S\\n]*(?:公里|公尺|米|英里|英尺|码|碼|海里)[^\\S\\n]*(?:\\n|$))\\S"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "maneuver": {
          "type": "literal",
          "value": "ROUNDABOUT"
        },
        "distanceMeters": {
          "type": "distance",
          "field": "combinedText"
        },
        "primaryText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "^([^\\n]+?)(?:[^\\S\\n]+[\\d.,]+[^\\S\\n]*(?:公里|公尺|米|英里|英尺|码|碼|海里))?[^\\S\\n]*(?:\\n|$)",
          "group": 1
        },
        "compactText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "^(?:从|在|自)(第\\s*\\d+\\s*個?\\s*出口(?:驶离|驶出到|過去|往|離開)?[^\\S\\n]+[^\\n]+?)(?:[^\\S\\n]+[\\d.,]+[^\\S\\n]*(?:公里|公尺|米|英里|英尺|码|碼|海里))?[^\\S\\n]*(?:\\n|$)",
          "group": 1
        },
        "secondaryText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?m)^[^•\\n]+•[^•\\n]+•\\s*([^•\\n]*?\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}[^•\\n]*?)\\s*(?:•|$)",
          "group": 1
        },
        "etaEpochSeconds": {
          "type": "arrivalClock",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?m)^[^•\\n]+•[^•\\n]+•\\s*([^•\\n]*?\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}[^•\\n]*?)\\s*(?:•|$)",
          "group": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "osmand-roundabout-zh",
      "enabled": true,
      "priority": 190,
      "packageNames": [
        "net.osmand",
        "net.osmand.plus",
        "net.osmand.dev",
        "net.osmand.huawei"
      ],
      "comment": "From OsmAnd's instruction strings (res/values-zh-rTW and values-zh-rCN/strings.xml, 2026-10-04; #61, #57), which its notification shows verbatim. Synthetic until captured. \\b only next to ASCII letters, so JVM, Android and workbench agree. No locales: OsmAnd's own language can differ from the phone's, and Chinese can't collide with other languages. zh-rTW uses '向左急轉' for slight turns too, so those show as sharp.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "field": "combinedText",
          "operator": "regex",
          "value": "圓環|环岛|\\d+\\s*個?\\s*出口"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "maneuver": {
          "type": "literal",
          "value": "ROUNDABOUT"
        },
        "distanceMeters": {
          "type": "distance",
          "field": "combinedText"
        },
        "primaryText": {
          "type": "firstNonEmpty",
          "fields": [
            "title",
            "text"
          ],
          "stripLeadingDistance": true
        },
        "secondaryText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?m)^[^•\\n]+•[^•\\n]+•\\s*([^•\\n]*?\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}[^•\\n]*?)\\s*(?:•|$)",
          "group": 1
        },
        "etaEpochSeconds": {
          "type": "arrivalClock",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?m)^[^•\\n]+•[^•\\n]+•\\s*([^•\\n]*?\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}[^•\\n]*?)\\s*(?:•|$)",
          "group": 1
        }
      }
    },
